:S-TAGPool a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "S-TAG Pool" ;
    rdfs:comment "The range of S-TAG values associated with an NNI Link. Start of pool greater than or equal to 1; end of pool less than or equal to 4000. [extension: Wholesale Broadband Agreement - Product Technical Specification - nbn Ethernet Product Module, Table 13, page 43]" ;
